                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains demographic, economic and automation data for Denmark, Finland, Spain, Sweden and the United Kingdom\nThe description of the data sources for country specific data and metrics is found for each country in the tabs with the country names\nThe data are found in the tabs with the name \"COUNTRY - Panel\"\n\nThe description of the data that are COMMON for all countries and relate to Economic and Automation inputs are included in the tab with the name \"IFR - EUKLEMS\"\nThe data for robot adoption matched to country-industry level (EU KLEMS - IFR) is in the tab EUKLEMS_ROBOTS"
